WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.396 --> 00:00:02.676
Wow! [s@Wow!

2
00:00:03.377 --> 00:00:04.417
Who are you?

3
00:00:04.697 --> 00:00:06.377
I'm a manatee.

4
00:00:06.638 --> 00:00:12.999
We are big mammals.

5
00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:18.441
You live in the sea, right?

6
00:00:31.044 --> 00:00:33.526
Manatees live in oceans and rivers.

7
00:00:36.287 --> 00:00:37.708
We like warm water.

8
00:00:39.509 --> 00:00:41.130
So we move to stay warm.

9
00:00:43.851 --> 00:00:44.932
What do you eat?

10
00:00:46.513 --> 00:00:48.114
We eat lots of plants.

11
00:00:50.235 --> 00:00:53.257
Sometimes we eat tiny fish by mistake.

12
00:00:56.018 --> 00:00:57.659
Are you a sea cow?

13
00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:01.362
Yes. Some people call us sea cows.

14
00:01:03.143 --> 00:01:04.665
But we're more like elephants.

15
00:01:06.286 --> 00:01:08.628
We both have thick skin and toenails.

16
00:01:10.890 --> 00:01:12.872
Do you ever go on land?

17
00:01:14.734 --> 00:01:16.856
No. Manatees stay in the water.

18
00:01:17.896 --> 00:01:19.498
But we come up often for air.

19
00:01:24.963 --> 00:01:26.004
How do you swim?

20
00:01:28.352 --> 00:01:30.533
We use our strong tails to move.

21
00:01:32.714 --> 00:01:34.355
We steer with our flippers.

22
00:01:35.715 --> 00:01:37.276
Do you have any enemies?

23
00:01:37.416 --> 00:01:39.557
We are gentle and friendly.

24
00:01:39.617 --> 00:01:41.538
But sometimes people hunt us.

25
00:01:56.544 --> 00:01:59.109
They also pollute our oceans and rivers.

26
00:02:01.414 --> 00:02:02.796
It's time for another swim.

27
00:02:04.179 --> 00:02:08.687
Good-bye! So long, Manatee!
